OL,3,GNEWSADomestic violence services at risk
OL,4,Aof closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupport services for victims of
OL,7,Fdomestic abuse have said they are
OL,8,Fworried about their future as they
OL,9,Fbattle for grant funding to keep
OL,10,Foperating.
OL,12,FThe Lotus drop-in service in Barnsley,
OL,13,Frun by the charity Resolute Women's
OL,14,FCentre, could close later this month if
OL,15,Fit does not raise #20,000.
OL,17,FVida, a domestic and sexual abuse
OL,18,Fcharity in Sheffield, closed in August
OL,19,Fafter 30 years because a funding crisis
OL,20,Fleft it without "sustainable long-term
OL,21,Fsupport".
