OL,3,GNEWSADomestic violence services at risk
OL,4,Aof closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite government investment in
OL,7,Ftackling violence against women and
OL,8,Fgirls, local charities have argued that
OL,9,Fthe grant system favours larger
OL,10,Forganisations.
